[135.338812, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Incident Summary\n- **Host**: `redis-prod-01`\n- **OS**: Debian 12\n- **Attacker Origin IP**: `198.51.100.170` (cited in `/disk/var/log/auth.log:208` and `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`)\n- **Primary Compromise Vector**: Unauthenticated Redis instance bound to all interfaces (`0.0.0.0`) without password authentication (cited in `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`)\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n| Timestamp (UTC) | Event Description | Evidence Source / Citation |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2026-08-11 00:53:46 | Attacker initiates SSH brute-force attack from `198.51.100.170` | `/disk/var/log/auth.log:176` |\n| 2026-08-11 00:55:02 | Attacker gains SSH root access via password login from `198.51.100.170` | `/disk/var/log/auth.log:208` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:00:00 (approx) | Exploitation of unauthenticated Redis via `CONFIG SET` commands | `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3` and `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:07:05 | Malicious cron task executed, dropping reverse shell / beacon payload | `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:4` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:10:00 | Cryptominer (`kdevtmpfsi`) deployed and executed (PID 1337) | `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:3` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:15:00 | Userland rootkit installed via `/etc/ld.so.preload` pointing to `/lib/.hide.so` | `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:20:00 | Kernel/Loadable module rootkit staged at `/tmp/.redis/exp.so` | `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:3` |\n| 2026-08-11 01:25:00 | Anti-forensics / log wiping performed, leaving residual cache artifact | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` |\n| 2026-08-11 03:20:00 | SOC Incident Intake opened following EDR high-severity alerts | `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` |\n\n## Checklist & Verification Status\n\n- [x] Initial triage of SAS alerts (`/sas/alerts.json`)\n- [x] Review CTI vendor threat advisory (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\n- [x] Disk evidence collection and analysis (`/disk`)\n- [x] Identify entry vector & baseline weaknesses (`/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`)\n- [x] Identify persistence mechanisms (Cron: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:4`, Preload: `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`)\n- [x] Identify impact artifacts (`/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:3`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:3`)\n- [x] Identify defense evasion / log wiping (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`)\n- [x] Reconcile change ticket CHG-5677 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)\n- [x] Complete required reports in `/app/`\nEOF\n"]
