[146.99963, "o", "> On host `redis-prod-01`, an external threat actor (`198.51.100.170`) gained access by abusing an unauthenticated Redis service exposed to all interfaces (`0.0.0.0`). The attacker leveraged Redis `CONFIG SET` commands to write a persistence payload into the root crontab, dropped an XMRig cryptominer (`kdevtmpfsi`), established userland rootkit persistence via `/etc/ld.so.preload`, staged a loadable module exploit (`exp.so`), and performed log wiping. EDR alerting (`/sas/alerts.json`) detected only the cryptominer process and crontab file, missing the silent `LD_PRELOAD` rootkit, staged module, and log wipe activity.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Entities & Indicators of Compromise (IoCs)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Indicator Type | Value | Citation |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> |---|---|---|\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Attacker Origin IP | `198.51.100.170` | `/disk/var/log/auth.log:208`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | C2 Infrastructure Domain | `update-redis.example.cn` | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Cryptomining Pool | `stratum+tcp://xmr.redis.evil:3333` | `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:4`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:4` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Monero Wallet | `4A00000000000000000031c7d95fb9f3` | `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:5`, `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:5` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Miner Process File | `/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi` | `/disk/tmp/.redis/kdevtmpfsi:1`, `/sas/alerts.json` (ALERT-01) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Staged Exploit Module | `/tmp/.redis/exp.so` | `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:1` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Preload Rootkit File | `/etc/ld.so.preload` -> `/lib/.hide.so` | `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Root Crontab File | `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root` | `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:4`, `/sas/alerts.json` (ALERT-02) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> | Residual Cache Artifact | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Comprehensive Attack Chain Mapping (MITRE ATT&CK)"]
