04h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 6379 -i eth0 -j DROP\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   iptables -L INPUT -n -v | grep 6379\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
