[178.042481, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.042893, "o", "- **Objective**: Disable userland library preloading and preserve evidence.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.043091, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/ld.so.preload:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.043207, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rf\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.043591, "o", "  # Backup and neutralize preload configuration\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp -a /etc/ld.so.preload /var/backups/quarantine/ld.so.preload.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.043718, "o", "  if [ -f /lib/.hide.so ]; then\r\n\u001b[?2004l\ror"]
[178.043758, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.043976, "o", "    cp -a /lib/.hide.so /var/backups/quarantine/hide.so.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\ri\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.04403, "o", ">     rm -f /lib/.hide.so\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.044136, "o", ">   fi\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.04421, "o", "  > /etc/ld.so.preload\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r37\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.044376, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.044562, "o", "  cat /etc/ld.so.preload\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.044598, "o", ">   ls -la /lib/.hide.so 2>&1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.044675, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.044774, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.044951, "o", "### Step 2.3: Quarantine Staged Exploit / Kernel Module (`/tmp/.redis/exp.so`)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.045136, "o", "- **Objective**: Quarantine staged kernel/loadable module rootkit file.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.045438, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/tmp/.redis/exp.so:3`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.045502, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   cp -a /tmp/.redis/exp.so /var/backups/quarantine/exp.so.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.045569, "o", "  chmod 000 /var/backups/quarantine/exp.so.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.045716, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   rm -f /tmp/.redis/exp.so\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.045882, "o", "  rmdir /tmp/.redis 2>/dev/null || true\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.045941, "o", ">   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.045967, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046101, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046159, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046172, "o", "  ls -la /tmp/.redis/exp.so 2>&1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.046265, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046309, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.046466, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046484, "o", "### Step 2.4: Sanitize Root Crontab Persistence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046672, "o", "- **Objective**: Remove malicious cron entry written via Redis `CONFIG SET` exploit.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.046818, "o", "> "]
[178.046964, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root:4`, `/sas/alerts.json` (ALERT-02).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.046978, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.047014, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047107, "o", "  # Backup crontab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.047131, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047305, "o", "  cp -a /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root /var/backups/quarantine/crontab_root.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.047337, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047454, "o", "  # Remove malicious curl line\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047677, "o", "  sed -i '/198.51.100.170/d' /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047748, "o", "  sed -i '/kdevtmpfsi\\|xmrig\\|pgdaemon/d' /var/spool/cron/crontabs/root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047815, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.047901, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.047941, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.047953, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048047, "o", "  crontab -l -u root\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048107, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.048146, "o", "> "]
[178.048307, "o", "### Step 2.5: Preserve Wiped Residual Cache Evidence\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.048329, "o", "> "]
[178.048413, "o", "- **Objective**: Quarantine anti-forensic residual cache file for upstream analysis.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.048427, "o", "> "]
[178.048498, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048538, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.04856, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048651, "o", "  cp -a /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin /var/backups/quarantine/wiped.bin.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.0487, "o", "  rm -f /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.048717, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048775, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048899, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.048937, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.048965, "o", "  ls -la /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin 2>&1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.049071, "o", "## Phase 3: System Hardening & Baseline Remediation (Priority 3 — High)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.04909, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.049137, "o", "### Step 3.1: Hardening Redis Service Configuration\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.049365, "o", "- **Objective**: Enforce authentication, localhost binding, and protected mode in `/etc/redis/redis.conf`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.049415, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.049614, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/redis/redis.conf:3`, `/sas/baseline.json:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.049714, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.049737, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.049772, "o", "> "]
[178.049837, "o", "  # Backup redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050006, "o", "  cp -a /etc/redis/redis.conf /var/backups/quarantine/redis.conf.bak\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050104, "o", "  # Apply baseline settings\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050257, "o", "  sed -i 's/bind 0.0.0.0/bind 127.0.0.1/' /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050383, "o", "  sed -i 's/protected-mode no/protected-mode yes/' /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.05046, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050556, "o", "  echo \"requirepass $(openssl rand -hex 24)\" >> /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.050566, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050706, "o", "  echo \"rename-command CONFIG \\\"\\\"\" >> /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050843, "o", "  echo \"rename-command FLUSHALL \\\"\\\"\" >> /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.050903, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.050989, "o", "  echo \"rename-command SAVE \\\"\\\"\" >> /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[178.051057, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051067, "o", "  # Restart Redis service"]
[178.051124, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051258, "o", "  systemctl restart redis-server\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051316, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051363, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.051398, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051424, "o", "  ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.051465, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.051627, "o", "  grep -E \"bind|protected-mode|requirepass|rename-command\" /etc/redis/redis.conf\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.051645, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.05175, "o", "> "]
[178.051861, "o", "  redis-cli -h 127.0.0.1 ping\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.051942, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.052006, "o", "> "]
[178.052079, "o", "### Step 3.2: Hardening SSH Access"]
[178.052115, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.052173, "o", "> "]
[178.0523, "o", "- **Objective**: Disable SSH root password authentication and enforce public keys.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.052374, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.05245, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/var/log/auth.log:208`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.052496, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.052631, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash"]
[178.052702, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.052746, "o", "> "]
[178.052844, "o", "  sed -i 's/PermitRootLogin yes/PermitRootLogin prohibit-password/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config"]
[178.052909, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.052921, "o", "> "]
[178.053116, "o", "  sed -i 's/PasswordAuthentication yes/PasswordAuthentication no/' /etc/ssh/sshd_config\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.053228, "o", "  systemctl restart sshd\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Verification Command**:"]
[178.053314, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   ```bash\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.053465, "o", "  sshd -T | grep -E \"permitrootlogin|passwordauthentication\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.053485, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.053545, "o", "  ```"]
[178.053591, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.053628, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.053729, "o", "### Step 3.3: Fortify Filesystem Execution Protections"]
[178.053775, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.05384, "o", "> "]
[178.053939, "o", "- **Objective**: Configure `/tmp` mount options with `noexec,nosuid,nodev` in `/etc/fstab`."]
[178.054041, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.054053, "o", "> "]
[178.054092, "o", "- **Evidence Citation**: `/disk/etc/fstab:1`."]
[178.054105, "o", "\r\n"]
[178.05419, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.054276, "o", "- **Action Commands**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.054351, "o", ">   ```bash"]
[178.05436, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.054501, "o", "  echo \"tmpfs /tmp tmpfs defaults,noexec,nosuid,nodev 0 0\" >> /etc/fstab\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.054564, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.05465, "o", "  mount -o remount,noexec,nosuid,nodev /tmp\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.054711, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.054823, "o", "- **Verification Command**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.054833, "o", ">   ```bash"]
[178.054885, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.054951, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.055114, "o", ">   mount | grep /tmp\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.055184, "o", "  ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.055296, "o", "---\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[178.055313, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.055344, "o", "## Phase 4: Post-Remediation Verification Matrix"]
[178.05538, "o", "\r\n"]
[178.055399, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.055469, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.055519, "o", "> "]
[178.055618, "o", "| Item | Check Description | Expected Result | Verification Command |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.055675, "o", "> "]
[178.055699, "o", "|---|---|---|---|"]
[178.055726, "o", "\r\n"]
[178.055762, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.055825, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.05601, "o", "| 1 | Cryptominer execution | No `kdevtmpfsi` running | `pgrep -f kdevtmpfsi` (empty) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.056045, "o", "| 2 | Root cron persistence | Clean crontab | `crontab -l -u root` |"]
[178.05612, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.056189, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.056297, "o", "| 3 | Preload hook | File empty or missing | `cat /etc/ld.so.preload` (empty) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.056366, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.056464, "o", "| 4 | Redis binding | Bound to `127.0.0.1` | `ss -tulpn | grep 6379` |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[178.056579, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[178.056693, "o", "| 5 | Redis Auth | Unauthenticated ping rejected | `redis-cli ping` (NOAUTH error) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.056844, "o", "> "]
[178.05698, "o", "| 6 | SSH Root Auth | Root password login refused | `ssh root@localhost` (Permission denied) |\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[178.056996, "o", "> "]
[178.057015, "o", "EOF"]
